  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agro logistics mission from Angola to the Netherlands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Angola is diversifying its oil driven economy and the Netherlands embassy has been supporting interventions aiming to develop the agricultural sector and exports.Especially the development of the cold chain in the Lobito corridor and exports of fresh fruits are expected to create economic opportunities for Angolan producers and farmers, as well as possibilities for Dutch businesses to contribute to this development.</narrative>
  </description>
